<title>DENMARK: A.P.Moeller buys Chinese vessel.</title>
<headline>A.P.Moeller buys Chinese vessel.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping group A.P.Moeller said on Tuesday that it had ordered two 110,00 dwt twin-hulled product carriers from China's Dalian New Shipyard, at an undisclosed price.</p>
</text>
